{"level":"info","message":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n\n<h1>Team Weekly Summary</h1>\n\n<h2>Achievements and Teamwork</h2>\n<p>This week, the team made progress on several key areas.  Manas Dadheech worked on DCPEXP-107946, focusing on Prod Amp updates and Streaming UI improvements. Shiv Shankar Mistry prepared deskcheck screenshots for a pricing update and also worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow.  Tandrima Bhattacharjee resolved tabbing and styling issues (DCPEXP-108292), prepared for desk checks, and participated in daily stand-ups.  She also created a pull request (https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887) and collaborated with Shiv and Narayan on AMP URL modifications and updates related to free trial expiry.</p>\n<p>Shivanand Yadav contributed to DCPEXP-106306 (Free trial to paid logic updates) and discussed string changes on AMP with Nitish Jain.</p>\n\n\n<h2>Leave and Holiday Information</h2>\n<p>Several team members took leave this week. Diya Khandelwal was on casual leave from March 3rd to March 5th for travel. Manas Dadheech took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd due to illness and travel complications. Narayan Shettigar also took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd. Shivanand Yadav took a full day of casual leave on March 4th and 5th for a family function. </p>\n\n\n<h2>Backlogs and Issues</h2>\n<p>No significant backlogs or issues were reported this week. </p>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","service":"summary-service"}
