{"level":"info","message":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n\n<h1>Team Summary for the Week of 2025-03-01 to 2025-03-06</h1>\n\n<h2>Achievements and Teamwork</h2>\n<p>This week, the team made progress on several key areas.  Manas Dadheech worked on DCPEXP-107946, focusing on Prod Amp updates for Streaming UI.  Shiv Shankar Mistry prepared desk check screenshots for a pricing update and also worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow. Tandrima Bhattacharjee fixed tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared desk checks, and participated in daily stand-ups.  She also raised a pull request (https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887) and collaborated with Shiv and Narayan on AMP URL modifications and update out of free trial changes. Shivanand Yadav worked on DCPEXP-106306, focusing on free trial to paid logic updates and had discussions with Nitish regarding string changes on AMP.</p>\n\n\n<h2>Leave and Holiday Information</h2>\n<p>The following leave information was recorded for the week: Diya Khandelwal was on approved casual leave for the full days of March 3rd, 4th and 5th, for travel. Manas Dadheech took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd due to illness and travel issues. Narayan Shettigar also took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd due to illness. Shivanand Yadav took a full day of casual leave on March 4th and 5th to attend a family function.  There were no reported holidays during this period.</p>\n\n\n<h2>Backlogs and Issues</h2>\n<p>No specific backlogs or issues were explicitly reported this week. However, ongoing work on items such as accessibility testing and free trial to paid logic updates suggests there is work in progress that might require continued effort.</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","service":"summary-service"}
