{"level":"info","message":"```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n\n<h3><b>Achievements and Work as a Team</b></h3>\n<p><b>Manas Dadheech</b> worked on DCPEXP-107946,  Prod Amp updates, and Streaming UI updates.  <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared desk check screenshots for pricing updates and worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow. <b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> fixed tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared for desk checks, and participated in daily standups. She also raised PR https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887 and collaborated with <b>Shiv</b> and <b>Narayan</b> on AMP URL modifications and free trial update changes.  <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> worked on DCPEXP-106306 (Free trial to paid logic updates) and had discussions with <b>Nitish Jain</b> regarding string changes on AMP.</p><br>\n\n<h3><b>Leave and Holiday Information</b></h3>\n<p><b>Diya Khandelwal</b> was on approved casual leave for the full days of March 3rd, 4th and 5th due to travel to her hometown. <b>Manas Dadheech</b> was on approved sick leave on March 3rd due to illness and travel difficulties.  <b>Narayan Shettigar</b> also took approved sick leave on March 3rd. <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> took approved casual leave for the full day of March 5th and 6th  to attend a family function.</p><br>\n\n<h3><b>Backlogs and Issues</b></h3>\n<p>No specific backlogs or issues were explicitly reported this week. However, ongoing work on accessibility,  pricing updates, and AMP URL modifications suggest a focus on these areas. Further details may be available in the referenced Jira tickets.</p><br>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n","service":"summary-service"}
