{"level":"info","message":"```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n\n<h3><b>Achievements and Work as a Team</b></h3>\n<p><b>Manas Dadheech</b> provided updates on DCPEXP-107946 and streaming UI updates.  <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared deskcheck screenshots for a pricing update and worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow.  <b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> fixed tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared for desk checks, and participated in daily standups.  She also raised a PR (https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887) and assisted <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> with AMP URL modifications.  <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> worked on DCPEXP-106306 (Free trial to paid logic updates) and had discussions with <b>Nitish Jain</b> regarding string changes on AMP. </p>\n\n<p>The team consistently participated in daily stand-ups, ensuring effective communication and collaboration throughout the week.  Progress was made on multiple tickets, focusing on both bug fixes and new feature development.  Testing efforts included accessibility checks and deskcheck preparations.</p>\n\n<h3><b>Leave and Holiday Information</b></h3>\n<p><b>Diya Khandelwal</b> was on full-day casual leave on 2025-03-04, 2025-03-05 and 2025-03-03 for travelling to her hometown. <b>Manas Dadheech</b> was on full-day sick leave on 2025-03-03 due to illness and travel complications. <b>Narayan Shettigar</b> was on full-day sick leave on 2025-03-03. <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> was on full-day casual leave on 2025-03-05 and 2025-03-04 for attending a family function.</p>\n\n<h3><b>Backlogs and Issues</b></h3>\n<p>No significant backlogs or issues were explicitly reported this week.  However, ongoing work on accessibility improvements and the free trial to paid logic updates (DCPEXP-106306) will require further attention in the coming week. </p>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n","service":"summary-service"}
