{"level":"info","message":"```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n\n<h3><b>Achievements and Work as a Team</b></h3>\n<p><b>Manas Dadheech</b> worked on DCPEXP-107946,  Prod Amp updates, and Streaming UI updates.  <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared deskcheck screenshots for a pricing update and worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow. <b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> fixed tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared for desk checks, and conducted daily stand-ups.  She also raised PR https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887 and assisted <b>Shiv</b> with AMP URL modifications.  <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> discussed string changes on AMP with <b>Nitish Jain</b> and worked on DCPEXP-106306, focusing on free trial to paid logic updates. </p>\n\n<h3><b>Leave and Holiday Information</b></h3>\n<p><b>Diya Khandelwal</b> was on full-day casual leave on March 3rd, 4th and 5th for travel. <b>Manas Dadheech</b> took a full-day sick leave on March 3rd due to illness and travel complications. <b>Narayan Shettigar</b> was on full-day sick leave on March 3rd. <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> took a full-day casual leave on March 5th and 6th to attend a family function. </p>\n\n<h3><b>Backlogs and Issues</b></h3>\n<p>No specific backlogs or issues were explicitly reported this week.  However, ongoing work on accessibility testing and updates to the free trial to paid logic suggest continuous development and potential challenges inherent in such tasks.</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n","service":"summary-service"}
