{"level":"info","message":"<h3><b>Achievements and Work as a Team</b></h3>\n\nThis week, the team made progress on several key areas.  <b>Manas Dadheech</b> worked on DCPEXP-107946, focusing on Prod Amp updates for Streaming UI.  <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared deskcheck screenshots for a pricing update and also worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow.  <b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> resolved tabbing and styling issues (DCPEXP-108292), completed desk check preparations, and contributed to a pull request (https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887).  She also collaborated with <b>Narayan Shettigar</b> and <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> on AMP URL modifications for production updates. <b>Shivanand Yadav</b>  worked on DCPEXP-106306, focusing on free trial to paid logic updates, and had discussions with <b>Nitish Jain</b> regarding string changes on AMP. Daily stand-ups were consistently attended by the team.\n\n\n<br>\n\n<h3><b>Leave and Holiday Information</b></h3>\n\nSeveral team members took leave this week.  <b>Diya Khandelwal</b> was on leave for three full days (March 3rd, 4th, and 5th) due to travel. <b>Manas Dadheech</b> took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd.  <b>Narayan Shettigar</b> also took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd. <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> took a full day of casual leave on March 5th and another on March 6th to attend family functions.\n\n\n<br>\n\n<h3><b>Backlogs and Issues</b></h3>\n\nNo significant backlogs or issues were reported this week.  The team addressed existing tasks and actively collaborated to resolve problems as they arose.\n\n\n<br>\n\n<h3><b>Additional Notes</b></h3>\n\nThe team maintained consistent communication throughout the week through daily stand-ups and collaboration on various tasks.  The updates provided offer a good overview of individual contributions and teamwork towards project goals.\n","service":"summary-service"}
